,"text":"▶︎ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうなんです！一時間、グアムの方が時間が早いからいつもと同じくらいの時間に更新するのにブログ送信時間を考えてたり\nまいちゅんと相部屋で先にお風呂はいって\nまいちゅんがお風呂中にブログを仕上げたり、いつもと違う感じで新鮮だったよ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/15/6775797/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃんにきいちゃおう！\n今日はおわり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/15/6775797/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方が考えてくださった\nブログ締めのあいさつ\n71回目はおとうふさんからです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次回のブログもYO!チェケラ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ps.未央奈と撮った動画のYO！チェケラ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またとりたいな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度は鎌倉とかで！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未央奈は私の心の中や悩みを\n何も言わなくてもすぐ気づいてくれます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も未央奈のそんな人になりたいよ"}],"source":"archive"}